reviewText:
It is a beautiful place to just embrace everything. If you really listen and relax and feel the beauty with the art Pieces, the Music and the breathing you can travel to places in mind that makes you feel like home in a way. I was there with a friend one time, but wasn’t really done when we left, so I went back with my dad. This time I had time to take it all in for real. Tears of joy, sadness, laughter and hope came down my cheeks. It made me joyful. Beautiful!!!

/Rebecka

@heartbyrebecka -Artist
